OL,3,GNEWSAFrom photo albums to apps: How the
OL,4,Afight against shoplifting changed
OL,5,
OL,6,FBefore smartphones, secure apps and
OL,7,Finstant alerts, tackling shoplifting in
OL,8,FStaffordshire relied on photo albums.
OL,10,FPacked with police custody images, they
OL,11,Fwere passed between stores to help
OL,12,Fstaff recognise banned shoplifters.
OL,14,FThe annual task of updating all 300
OL,15,Foften fell to Paul Greenhough.
OL,17,FNearly 40 years on, the county's
OL,18,Fapproach to retail crime has changed
OL,19,Fdramatically, but Greenhough says one
OL,20,Fthing has not.
